## How to publish a website

1. Generate files in _site 
In the root directory,
$ jekyll build

2. Connect to NSM server
- Open finder window and press cmd+K
- server address is smb://nsmn1.uh.edu/users/ycho22
- username: ycho22, password: UH password

3. Copy all the files in _site to ycho22

4. Go to ysc.chem.uh.edu and check if all the changes are applied properly.

